Do you have other places in mind to make use of this? This looks like its only used in tests and could also be a local test helper 

```
func resourceInModule(module Module, r Resource) ConfigResource {
  return ConfigResource{
    Module: module,
    Resource: r,
  }
}
```

Unless there is another use for this (I've very little context on this codebase a macro level) it seems unfortunate to expand the exported API of `Resource` for tests, especially given this isn't tested within the `addrs` module.
